        "DAC3484IZAY",
        "DAC3484IZAYR"
      ],
      "description": "The DAC3484 is a very low power, high dynamic range, quad-channel, 16-bit digital-to-analog converter (DAC) with a sample rate as high as 1.25 GSPS. The device includes features that simplify the design of complex transmit architectures: 2x to 16x digital interpolation filters, independent complex mixers, high-performance low jitter clock multiplier, and digital Quadrature Modulator Correction (QMC). Digital data is input through a 16-bit LVDS data bus. The device is characterized for operation over the industrial temperature range of -40°C to 85°C and is available in 88-pin WQFN or 196-ball NFBGA packages.",
